      "yanked": false,
      "notes": "AgentRT v0.1.18\n\n## 2. 平台支持\n\n- Linux（主力平台）：x86-64 / x86-32 / arm-64 / arm-32\n- macOS：arm-64（Apple Silicon）/ x86-64（Intel）\n- Windows：x86-64 / x86-32\n\n## 3. 安装\n\n```bash\ncurl -fsSL https://atomgit.com/openairymax/agentrt/releases/download/v0.1.18/install.sh | bash\n```\n\nWindows（PowerShell）：\n```powershell\nirm https://atomgit.com/openairymax/agentrt/releases/download/v0.1.18/install.ps1 | iex\n```\n\n## 4. 本版变更\n\n* latest: restore supervisor launcher and bump gate pins\n* launcher: fix AIRY_HOME discovery under versioned install layout\n* cmake: gate GCC-only stringop-overflow opt-out to GNU\n* daemons: converge three SSE parsers into core/sse.c\n* llm_d: sink provider secrets into core/secrets.c\n* daemons: advance pointer for llm_d provider header split\n* daemons: advance pointer for llm_d providers core/adapters reshuffle\n* daemons: advance pointer after llm_d B16-S2 inner de-dependency\n* daemons: advance pointer for B16-S1 hub header split\n* daemons: advance pointer for B16-S0 include-face collapse\n* gateway: advance for on-demand daemon activation\n* install: converge install face onto release assets and add npm\n* launcher: route daemon lifecycle through supervisor_d\n* cli: hide chain-of-thought from render and memory channels",
